约8年8个月。\n\n通过此次谈判，中方承诺在电影、游戏等领域给予韩方不低于第三国的待遇，即“最惠国待遇”。在程序方面，双方也同意对网络游戏、电影等内容的事前审查适用非歧视原则。此外，两国还就视听节目联合制作附件达成一致。因此，原协定中仅限于电影的联合制作范围，扩大至电视剧、动画、综艺节目和纪录片等。\n\n在旅游领域，双方将一项承诺纳入协定：在中国23个地区设立的韩国旅行社，可面向居住在中国的中国公民和外国人经营出境旅游业务。由此，为韩国旅行社直接招徕中国团体游客、直接销售个人旅游产品奠定了制度基础。\n\n政府将继续与中方开展工作层面的磋商，以最终确定协定文本，并将加快推进正式签署和生效的后续程序。”","tg":{"media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/lCF3fsoMm7WYhIlSm43IOYkKPfQb0cL35iD4hBf3CO87bkqbPUCDdsqElGO2DtbY924iKqON5bh6tgMSUd5icq40aN1V8Qy9ZKOwO2Wf6UsaIBMpJFSnOwpzVizwmkENOandOAhhR9SS0AAkBGSXd_EcwfwRYHSf1PQQU7z85KuVcz4WwTG_a5A8p5uzJXeicCSqhZb3TWzVq1wy1lxgozmNE0I98q1vFDQCZ6DEN_PLS6MDPk2buWeJlOWQs3W5jkuZBHysSrQ0tyE-fRYnHJJrjZX5kU2yt4L5Tz1eG_jM10Ofw94Zmnc0ECehgpObpAxvNb14hwCffx3GLv-F-Q.jpg"}],"views":2550,"views_label":"2.55K","reactions":[{"emoji":"❤","count":25,"label":"25"},{"emoji":"🤡","count":7,"label":"7"},{"emoji":"🥰","count":3,"label":"3"}],"fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:07:01+08:00"}},{"id":"freechinese:113457","kind":"news","channel":"current","source_id":"freechinese","source_name":"FREE 中文","title":"特朗普搭乘自动扶梯时伸手扶习近平在外网走红。","summary":"","url":"https://t.me/freechinese/113457","image":{"url":"media/freechinese/113457_1.webp","width":320,"height":180},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:23:21+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:10:13+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"特朗普搭乘自动扶梯时伸手扶习近平在外网走红。","tg":{"media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/5783267d84.mp4?token=qx8fWpZPR5eN5aY_pG4jspCBE7efjcEPSrukjSL-hyyGTlgiIn4gh2fuj2QOryWn97A0lHCujheyoDsaXkYuqZizh4_1xkqm6p-eTYZytEU4WVWgSVyJaEIaIVgMJtBb2kJF7yC4b73vUoQE13BP36F4XfAb6kdflVGuxiC68FfhoRnAQ826_L5-0jy0VsmERETa4NoTkcyr7OYzBMy2eFeYmllSCiV7xD7K3gkMnqYwme3CYwBIZPE_i2BwgEUO4MzwarwuJiyaWzhJl_PT62S6jTyHI3UHySol9MgLZx5PDUcoXYgRFSjmbgbXOfpUw1W-J2TG04gIaETKG1Bcuw","preview_url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/CmFfdlU-dEGJvQqHJ7S3kOLGPyEyGtpENL09Mssb0XYeqp3oHLl7u2spXAG1s2FlxOw7ht4mAmLOOxKc0FlkTXTkjaIPLLLtdbtHJbaOiLf2065ykZ5up1Sn_qRz-3OLFtXUw96OhO-3eFTtxWSCysuFjbsZ8GnnLduHUEupdeJ8ji3SBh